## 3. Non-Functional Requirements (NFRs)

- Latency: The ML Scoring API must return a response within 250ms at the 99th percentile (p99).
- Availability: The risk routing pipeline must maintain 99.95% uptime; ML service degradation must never block legitimate payment traffic.
- Data Integrity: Hard deletes are strictly prohibited on transaction and audit tables; all state transitions must be append-only.
- Security & Compliance: Full compliance with personal data protection regulations (PII masking before external API calls) and biometric verification mandates (SBV Decision 2345).
